1
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:07,000
And with that, the young little child drifted off to a nap.

2
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:10,450
 He won't wake up for a bit, not after this rap!

3
00:02:10,450 --> 00:02:13,400
For he is tired, and needs some sleep.

4
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:17,240
Now don't wake him up, or he shall cry and weep!

